      "name": "Note 1: Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        180,
        180
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### ⚙️ 2. Konfigurasi AI & Sheets\nMasukkan Gemini API Key Anda di sini (ID Google Sheet Anda sudah terisi otomatis).",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 260,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "ai-note-02",
      "name": "Note 2: Config",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        460,
        180
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 🤖 3. Google Gemini 1.5 Flash\nMengubah topik singkat menjadi caption profesional:\n- Hook pembuka yang memikat\n- Poin isi edukatif/promotif\n- Call To Action (ajakan interaksi)\n- 3-5 hashtag relevan",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 480,
        "color": 2
      },
      "id": "ai-note-03",
      "name": "Note 3: AI Engine",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        920,
        180
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 📝 4. Simpan ke Google Sheets\nMenyimpan teks caption ke kolom `generated_caption` dan mengubah status baris menjadi 'READY' (siap diterbitkan).",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 440,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "ai-note-04",
      "name": "Note 4: Save Result",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1420,
        180
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "2a9d1a20-3b4c-4d5e-8f6a-223344556601",
      "name": "Manual / On Click Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
